owers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-debian-package","state":"uploaded","size":245857482,"digest":"sha256:992d9529f58958f1b26494db905756511a6892c2ee4a4e2c9a24aa06bf275c3d","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-21T07:31:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T07:32:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/releases/download/v0.2.0/kernelmind-apex-manus-dex_0.2.0_jazzy_arm64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/tarball/v0.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/zipball/v0.2.0","body":"<html><head></head><body><h1>KernelMind Apex ManusDex v0.2.0</h1><p>首个支持 <strong>MANUS SDK 3.2.0 ARM64</strong> 的正式版本，可直接部署在 NVIDIA Jetson Orin / Thor 平台，无需额外 x86 PC 运行 MANUS 手套数据链路。</p><h2>Supported Platforms</h2>\r\nPlatform | OS | ROS 2 | Architecture | Package\r\n-- | -- | -- | -- | --\r\nNVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin | Ubuntu 22.04 | Humble | arm64 | kernelmind-apex-manus-dex_0.2.0_humble_arm64.deb\r\nNVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor | Ubuntu 24.04 | Jazzy | arm64 | kernelmind-apex-manus-dex_0.2.0_jazzy_arm64.deb\r\n\r\n<p>以上两个 ARM64 版本均已完成对应真机安装与运行验证。</p><h2>What's New</h2><ul><li><p>升级至 <strong>MANUS SDK 3.2.0</strong></p></li><li><p>新增 MANUS SDK <strong>ARM64 / aarch64</strong> 支持</p></li><li><p>支持 NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin 与 Jetson AGX Thor</p></li><li><p>同一套代码同时支持：</p><ul><li><p>ROS 2 Humble</p></li><li><p>ROS 2 Jazzy</p></li></ul></li><li><p>支持 MANUS Integrated 模式</p></li><li><p>集成 MANUS glove → ROS 2 → Wuji dexterous hand retargeting 数据链路</p></li><li><p>支持左右手双手 retargeting</p></li><li><p>支持 dynamic opposition</p></li><li><p>支持 bone length remapping</p></li><li><p>支持 MANUS calibration 文件自动加载</p></li><li><p>修复安装包运行时对开发 workspace 路径的依赖</p></li><li><p>ROS overlay 已完成 relocation，可独立安装运行</p></li><li><p>Python runtime 及 retargeting 相关依赖已随 deb 打包，无需用户单独配置 Conda 环境</p></li></ul><h2>Installation</h2><h3>Ubuntu 22.04 / ROS 2 Humble / ARM64</h3><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">sudo apt install ./kernelmind-apex-manus-dex_0.2.0_humble_arm64.deb\r\n</code></pre><h3>Ubuntu 24.04 / ROS 2 Jazzy / ARM64</h3><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">sudo apt install ./kernelmind-apex-manus-dex_0.2.0_jazzy_arm64.deb\r\n</code></pre><h2>⚠️ Important: MANUS USB Permission Setup</h2><p><strong>首次在一台新的 Ubuntu / Jetson 设备上使用 MANUS Dongle 时，必须先配置 USB 权限。</strong></p><p>如果没有执行此步骤，即使以下命令可以看到 MANUS Dongle：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">lsusb\r\n</code></pre><p>并显示类似：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">3325:0049 Manus VR (...) Sensor Dongle\r\n</code></pre><p>普通用户仍可能没有权限访问实际的 USB 设备节点，导致 MANUS SDK 无法正常使用 Dongle。</p><p>常见表现包括：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">No license found for session type 'CoreSDK'\r\n</code></pre><p>或者：</p><ul><li><p><code>manus-dex</code> 可以启动，但 MANUS glove 没有数据</p></li><li><p><code>/manus_glove_0</code>、<code>/manus_glove_1</code> topic 已创建但没有消息</p></li><li><p><code>/hand_left/joint_commands</code>、<code>/hand_right/joint_commands</code> 没有输出</p></li><li><p>MANUS Integrated 初始化异常</p></li></ul><h3>Configure MANUS USB permissions</h3><p>执行：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">sudo tee /etc/udev/rules.d/70-manus.rules &gt;/dev/null &lt;&lt;'EOF'\r\nSUBSYSTEM==\"usb\", ATTR{idVendor}==\"3325\", MODE=\"0666\"\r\nSUBSYSTEM==\"usb\", ATTR{idVendor}==\"1915\", ATTR{idProduct}==\"83fd\", MODE=\"0666\"\r\nKERNEL==\"hidraw*\", ATTRS{idVendor}==\"3325\", MODE=\"0666\"\r\nEOF\r\n\r\nsudo udevadm control --reload-rules\r\nsudo udevadm trigger\r\n</code></pre><p><strong>执行完成后，请将 MANUS USB Dongle 物理拔出并重新插入一次。</strong></p><p>然后确认设备：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">lsusb | grep -i manus\r\n</code></pre><p>应看到类似：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">3325:0049 Manus VR (...) Sensor Dongle\r\n</code></pre><p>检查 USB 权限：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">BUS_DEV=$(lsusb -d 3325:0049 | awk '{gsub(\":\",\"\",$4); print \"/dev/bus/usb/\"$2\"/\"$4}')\r\nls -l \"$BUS_DEV\"\r\n</code></pre><p>正常应包含：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">crw-rw-rw-\r\n</code></pre><p>例如：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">crw-rw-rw- 1 root root ... /dev/bus/usb/001/006\r\n</code></pre><blockquote><p><strong>注意：仅能通过 <code>lsusb</code> 看到 MANUS Dongle，并不能说明 USB 权限已经正确配置。请务必检查实际 <code>/dev/bus/usb/...</code> 设备节点权限。</strong></p></blockquote><h2>Start</h2><p>完成 deb 安装及 MANUS USB 权限配置后启动：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">manus-dex\r\n</code></pre><p>建议同时确保：</p><ul><li><p>MANUS Sensor Dongle 已插入</p></li><li><p>MANUS License / Dongle 授权有效</p></li><li><p>MANUS 手套已开机</p></li><li><p>手套能够正常连接对应 Dongle</p></li></ul><p>如果手套已经开机但没有数据，可尝试将手套<strong>关机后重新开机</strong>，使其重新建立与 Dongle 的无线连接。</p><h2>Runtime Verification</h2><p>查看 MANUS 输入话题：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">ros2 topic hz /manus_glove_0\r\nros2 topic hz /manus_glove_1\r\n</code></pre><p>查看 retargeting 输出：</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">ros2 topic hz /hand_left/joint_commands\r\nros2 topic hz /hand_right/joint_commands\r\n</code></pre><p>正常情况下，应持续输出消息频率。</p><p>如果 topic 存在但一直没有消息，请优先检查：</p><ol><li><p>MANUS USB 权限是否正确</p></li><li><p>MANUS Dongle 是否已重新拔插</p></li><li><p>MANUS License 是否有效</p></li><li><p>MANUS 手套是否已开机并连接 Dongle</p></li></ol><h2>Installed Location</h2><p>主程序安装至：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">/opt/kernelmind/manus_dex\r\n</code></pre><p>启动入口：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">/usr/bin/manus-dex\r\n</code></pre><p>MANUS calibration 文件位于：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">/opt/kernelmind/manus_dex/ros_overlay/share/manus_ros2/calibration\r\n</code></pre><h2>Runtime Environment</h2><h3>Humble / Orin</h3><ul><li><p>Python 3.10</p></li><li><p>NumPy 1.26.4</p></li><li><p>PyTorch 2.7.1 CPU</p></li><li><p>NLopt 2.7.1</p></li><li><p>Pinocchio 2.7.0</p></li><li><p>dex-retargeting 0.4.6</p></li></ul><h3>Jazzy / Thor</h3><ul><li><p>Python 3.12</p></li><li><p>NumPy 1.26.4</p></li><li><p>PyTorch 2.7.1 CPU</p></li><li><p>NLopt 2.7.1</p></li><li><p>Pinocchio 2.7.0</p></li><li><p>dex-retargeting 0.4.6</p></li></ul><h2>Validation</h2><h3>Orin / Humble / ARM64</h3><p>已验证：</p><ul><li><p>deb 安装成功</p></li><li><p>bundled Python runtime 正常</p></li><li><p>dex-retargeting / Pinocchio / NLopt 正常加载</p></li><li><p>ROS 2 C++ 动态库依赖完整</p></li><li><p>MANUS SDK Integrated 模式正常启动</p></li><li><p>HIDAPIBridge / EmbeddedBridge 正常启动</p></li><li><p>Manus Core 正常连接</p></li><li><p>Wuji retargeting 模块正常初始化</p></li><li><p>calibration 从正式安装目录加载</p></li><li><p>MANUS USB Dongle 正常访问</p></li><li><p>无开发 workspace / staging 路径残留</p></li></ul><h3>Thor / Jazzy / ARM64</h3><p>已验证：</p><ul><li><p>deb 安装成功</p></li><li><p>Python 3.12 bundled runtime 正常</p></li><li><p>ROS 2 Jazzy workspace 构建通过</p></li><li><p>ROS 2 C++ 动态库依赖完整</p></li><li><p>MANUS SDK Integrated 模式正常启动</p></li><li><p>Manus Core 正常连接</p></li><li><p>calibration 从正式安装目录加载</p></li><li><p>Wuji retargeting 模块正常初始化</p></li><li><p>MANUS USB Dongle 正常访问</p></li><li><p>无开发 workspace / staging 路径残留</p></li></ul><h2>Notes</h2><p>MANUS Integrated 模式需要有效的 MANUS 授权及对应硬件。</p><p>如果 MANUS USB 权限未正确配置，或者设备未连接有效的 MANUS License / Dongle，启动过程中可能看到：</p><pre><code class=\"language-text\">No license found for session type 'CoreSDK'\r\n</code></pre><p>该报错需要结合 USB 权限、Dongle、License 和手套连接状态综合判断。</p><p><strong>首次部署到新设备时，请优先完成上方 <code>MANUS USB Permission Setup</code>，否则可能导致 MANUS 数据链路无法正常工作。</strong></p><h2>Not Yet Hardware-Validated</h2><p>以下目标当前代码层面支持，但未进行本地 x86 真机验证：</p><ul><li><p>Ubuntu 22.04 / ROS 2 Humble / amd64</p></li><li><p>Ubuntu 24.04 / ROS 2 Jazzy / amd64</p></li></ul><p>推荐生产环境优先使用本 Release 提供并已验证的 ARM64 packages。</p></body></html>"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/releases/366069885","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/releases/366069885/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/releases/366069885/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Gento-Teleoperation-Apex/KernelMind_Apex_ManusDex_Deb/releases/tag/v0.1.1","id":366069885,"author":{"login":"hbr853744453-dev","id":236778159,"node_id":"U_kgDODhzyrw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236778159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/hbr853744453-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hbr853744453-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTvj1ic4V0ch9","tag_name":"v0.1.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.1.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prere